<title>USA: Tri Polyta says polypropylene demand down.</title>
<headline>Tri Polyta says polypropylene demand down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tri Polyta said Monday that it is experiencing reduced demand for its polypropylene products, with domestic sales below monthly averages.</p>
<p>The company said it believes this phenomenon is temporary and reflects a general business slowdown in Indonesia during the run-up to the May 29 parliamentary elections.</p>
</text>
